# Live-pad route after to-network.pad (send that first, then this), with tools/net/net-live.sh and ob_server.exe
# on its defaults (report entries 39-40): on a card that holds BWNETCNF the game shows "Network configuration file
# has loaded" instead of the NET CONNECTION list; the three downs + OK pass it and the game connects (TLS login,
# lobby). Then: user registration -> "don't register" -> handle name "あ" -> confirm -> lobby LOCAL -> ROOM LIST ->
# AREA 01 -> slot 1 (Vacant) -> RULE screen -> FINISH: the game sends its scenario (6509) and waits in the room
# (report entries 40, 44, 47).
press down 8
wait 60
press down 8
wait 60
press down 8
wait 60
press circle 8
wait 1800
shot l00-registration
# User registration: right = 登録しない (don't register).
press right 8
wait 30
press circle 8
wait 300
shot l02-handle
# Handle name: type あ (cursor starts there), then the 決定 key: down 3, right to the end of the bottom row. The
# cursor ignores moves for a while after the character is typed (entry 47): wait before moving it.
press circle 8
wait 240
press down 6
wait 20
press down 6
wait 20
press down 6
wait 20
press right 6
wait 20
press right 6
wait 20
press right 6
wait 20
press right 6
wait 20
press right 6
wait 20
press right 6
wait 20
press right 6
wait 20
press right 6
wait 20
press right 6
wait 20
press right 6
wait 20
press right 6
wait 20
press right 6
wait 20
press right 6
wait 20
press right 6
wait 20
press right 6
wait 20
press right 6
wait 20
press circle 8
wait 240
# "are you sure you want to use this (HN)?": left = 登録する (use it).
press left 6
wait 20
press circle 8
wait 300
shot l08-lobby
# Lobby LOCAL: ROOM LIST, AREA 01, slot 1 (Vacant: create a room), the RULE screen, Triangle = scenario list.
press circle 8
wait 240
shot l09-areas
press circle 8
wait 240
shot l10-rooms
press circle 8
wait 300
shot l11-rule
# RULE: down 8 to FINISH (the cursor stops there), OK: the game sends the scenario and opens the room.
press down 8
wait 30
press down 8
wait 30
press down 8
wait 30
press down 8
wait 30
press down 8
wait 30
press down 8
wait 30
press down 8
wait 30
press down 8
wait 30
press circle 8
wait 400
shot l12-room
